			<item>
				<title>OPL #02: Viết câu lệnh SQL tính hiệu suất thiết bị tổng thể (OEE) theo ca từ dữ liệu PLC</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/ot-tech-blog/posts/opl-02-sql-oee-calculation/</link>
				<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/ot-tech-blog/posts/opl-02-sql-oee-calculation/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-bài-toán-thực-tế-trong-nhà-máy&#34;&gt;1. Bài toán Thực tế trong Nhà máy&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#1-b%c3%a0i-to%c3%a1n-th%e1%bb%b1c-t%e1%ba%bf-trong-nh%c3%a0-m%c3%a1y&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Thay vì để đội vận hành ghi chép tay sản lượng, thời gian dừng máy vào Excel cuối mỗi ca, hệ thống SCADA/Historian hoàn toàn có thể tự động tính toán &lt;strong&gt;OEE (Overall Equipment Effectiveness)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Bài học 1 điểm này hướng dẫn cách viết một câu lệnh SQL chuẩn hóa để tính toán OEE từ hai bảng dữ liệu gốc đẩy từ PLC lên Database: &lt;code&gt;machine_runtime_logs&lt;/code&gt; (nhật ký trạng thái) và &lt;code&gt;production_counters&lt;/code&gt; (sản lượng đếm).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>OPL #01: Cấu hình Grafana Control Room Dashboard kết nối PostgreSQL Query Time-Series</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/ot-tech-blog/posts/opl-grafana-postgresql/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/ot-tech-blog/posts/opl-grafana-postgresql/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-mục-tiêu-bài-học-1-điểm-opl&#34;&gt;1. Mục tiêu Bài học 1 điểm (OPL)&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#1-m%e1%bb%a5c-ti%c3%aau-b%c3%a0i-h%e1%bb%8dc-1-%c4%91i%e1%bb%83m-opl&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Chuẩn hóa câu lệnh SQL truy vấn dữ liệu chuỗi thời gian (&lt;em&gt;Time-series Query&lt;/em&gt;) từ PostgreSQL để trực quan hóa chỉ số &lt;strong&gt;MTTR (Mean Time to Repair)&lt;/strong&gt; theo tuần trên Grafana Control Room Dashboard.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;2-truy-vấn-sql-chuẩn-hóa-postgresql-time-series-query&#34;&gt;2. Truy vấn SQL Chuẩn hóa (PostgreSQL Time-Series Query)&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#2-truy-v%e1%ba%a5n-sql-chu%e1%ba%a9n-h%c3%b3a-postgresql-time-series-query&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sql&#34; data-lang=&#34;sql&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;-- Truy vấn tính MTTR trung bình theo từng tuần&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;SELECT&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010&#34;&gt;\$&lt;/span&gt;__timeGroupAlias(start_time, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;w),&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;AVG&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;EXTRACT&lt;/span&gt;(EPOCH &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;FROM&lt;/span&gt; (end_time &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; start_time))&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;3600&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;AS&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;MTTR (Hours)&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;,&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;COUNT&lt;/span&gt;(event_id) &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;AS&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Total Failures&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;FROM&lt;/span&gt; downtime_events&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;WHERE&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  category &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;Unplanned Breakdown&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;AND&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010&#34;&gt;\$&lt;/span&gt;__timeFilter(start_time)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;GROUP&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;BY&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;ORDER&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;BY&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;ASC&lt;/span&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;3-cấu-hình-panel-trên-grafana&#34;&gt;3. Cấu hình Panel trên Grafana&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#3-c%e1%ba%a5u-h%c3%acnh-panel-tr%c3%aan-grafana&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Source&lt;/strong&gt;: Chọn PostgreSQL Database.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Panel Type&lt;/strong&gt;: Time Series.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Threshold Cảnh báo&lt;/strong&gt;:&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;🟢 &lt;strong&gt;An toàn (Green)&lt;/strong&gt;: MTTR &amp;lt; 1.0 giờ.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;🟡 &lt;strong&gt;Cảnh báo (Yellow)&lt;/strong&gt;: 1.0 giờ ≤ MTTR ≤ 2.5 giờ.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;🔴 &lt;strong&gt;Nợ kỹ thuật cao (Red)&lt;/strong&gt;: MTTR &amp;gt; 2.5 giờ.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;</description>
			</item>
	</channel>
